(text "SSTX AC coupling 100nF (0201) at device side.\nMux: SEL=0 -> A<->B (TX1/RX1), SEL=1 -> A<->C (TX2/RX2).\nUSB_FLIP=0 when CC1 is the active CC line.\nDiff pairs: 90 Ohm, length-matched; mux next to J1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 124.46 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4c719b87-f72c-5caa-a1eb-5f821be8d8c6"))
(text "Comparator: OUT = (CC_REF 0.157V > CC1)\nCC1 active (0.25..2.04V) -> USB_FLIP=0 -> TX1/RX1\nCC2 active (CC1 ~ 0V)    -> USB_FLIP=1 -> TX2/RX2\nUSB_FLIP also read by CH569 PB3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e19b9c8a-8d07-5133-95c1-c06f739b2646"))
(text "3V3: Vout = 0.6 * (1 + 150k/33.2k) = 3.31 V, 2 A\nL = 2.2 uH, Isat >= 3 A" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 320.04 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3dd2c410-244d-5843-888d-b1dd0d374563"))
(text "1V0 (GW2AR VCC/VCCPLL): Vout = 0.6 * (1 + 100k/150k) = 1.00 V\nEN <- PG_3V3: core rail starts after 3V3" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 320.04 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2ccdfb63-297f-5922-ad58-9a862796dbfa"))
